    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Corsair Coterie",
    "summary": "Whenever an enemy unit completes a Normal move, Advance move, Fall Back move or Charge move and is then in range of one of your controlled objective markers, you roll a D6, and on 2+ the unit takes D3 mortal wounds. Your ANHRATHE units have Void Thieves: when any phase ends with such a unit in range of a marker you control, that marker stays yours until a phase ends with the opponent holding a greater Level of Control there than you.",
